{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261020%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1430　23庭　法官陳慶偉<br/>53歲無業男向11歲女兒施安眠藥後侵犯　認企圖強姦等8罪｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭紀航<br/>男警涉申按揭貸款時謊稱自住｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 1415　3庭　裁判官吳卓樺<br/>被指沒適當加上食品標籤　膳心小館母企被票控｜再提堂<br/>售賣月餅及鹹肉粽等預先包裝食物　「如一」被指沒適當加上標籤｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸屯門法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官覃有方<br/>兩歲女童手部皮膚嚴重燒傷　印傭被控虐兒｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T11:59:11.089980+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":395,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:56:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:57:34.724141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T11:57:34.724141+00:00","content_hash":"8fd0ad8396cbf3edeb288e9aac013c09960747090ddc0c41ffd969b452013793","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}